        "prompt": "$(3a^{2/3}-2a^{-2/3}b^{1/2}-b^{-1/2})(a^{1/3}-2b)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$3a-2a^{-1/3}b^{1/2}-a^{1/3}b^{-1/2}-6a^{2/3}b+4a^{-2/3}b^{3/2}+2b^{1/2}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(3a^{2/3}-2a^{-2/3}b^{1/2}-b^{-1/2})(a^{1/3}-2b)&=3a^{2/3+1/3}-6a^{2/3}b\\\\&\\quad-2a^{-2/3+1/3}b^{1/2}+4a^{-2/3}b^{1/2+1}\\\\&\\quad-a^{1/3}b^{-1/2}+2b^{-1/2+1}\\end{align*}$$\nThus the expansion is\n$$3a-2a^{-1/3}b^{1/2}-a^{1/3}b^{-1/2}-6a^{2/3}b+4a^{-2/3}b^{3/2}+2b^{1/2}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      },
      {
        "id": "p35-q9-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$(a^{3/4}+a^{1/2}b^{1/2}+a^{1/4}b+b^{3/2})(a^{1/4}-b^{1/2})$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a-b^2$",
          "worked": "Let $A=a^{1/4}$ and $B=b^{1/2}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}(A^3+A^2B+AB^2+B^3)(A-B)&=A^4-A^3B+A^3B-A^2B^2\\\\&\\quad+A^2B^2-AB^3+AB^3-B^4\\\\(A^3+A^2B+AB^2+B^3)(A-B)&=A^4-B^4\\\\(A^3+A^2B+AB^2+B^3)(A-B)&=a-b^2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      }
    ]
